# Ignore build outputs across all projects
**/build/
**/Debug/
**/Release/
**/bin/
**/obj/

# Ignore auto-generated CubeMX toolchains and settings across all projects
**/cmake/
**/CMakeLists.txt
**/CMakePresets.json
**/*.mxproject
**/*.launch
**/temp/

# Ignore heavy HAL Drivers and CMSIS libraries in every project subfolder
**/Drivers/
**/Core/Src/syscalls.c
**/Core/Src/sysmem.c

# Ignore heavy media assets (images/videos) you don't want bloating GitHub
**/*.mp4
**/*.png
**/*.jpg
**/*.jpeg

# Keep backup files out
**/*.bak